  "details": "Currently, all avatars in an instance are loaded automatically based on distance or priority settings.\n\nHowever, some avatars don't need to load if the world is divided into rooms such as [ひまり旅館](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_d619675d-139d-4e58-bcda-da26a3c75c0e),  and it will be a waste of bandwidth and processing power.\n\nTherefore, I would like to request the addition of a feature whereby avatars load or unload depending on whether players are in the same  collider bounds.\n\nAs a secondary benefit, this feature has a security advantage in that it protects users who are outside the avatar load area from broken or malicious avatars which crash clients.",
